<title>USA: CNA Financial unit to open Toronto office.</title>
<headline>CNA Financial unit to open Toronto office.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNA Re, a division of CNA Financial Corp, said Wednesday it will open a branch office in Toronto that will serve Canadian clients previously served from by employees in Chicago.</p>
<p>CNA Re, which offers reinsurance coverage, has offices in 12 major cities around the world and annual premium income of more than $1.3 billion.</p>
<p>CNA Re is part of CNA Financial, an insurance holding company with assets of $60 billion at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>Its shares closed off 1/2 Wednesday at 114.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
